  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Squall</defName>
    <label>squall</label>
    <description>Squalls were small lagomorphs originally from the planet Chandrila. Squall instinctively seemed to want to be around other non-predatory creatures of any species, including sentient species. When in the company of other creatures, they typically begged for food or raided unguarded food stores. In the Core Worlds, squalls were renowned for their cuteness, and even further out, most beings found it hard to see them as anything but adorable. Squalls were common pets with most young girls either having one or wanting one, expediting their spread across the galaxy.</description>
